🛠️ Phase 1: Core Frameworks & Environment
Choose your building stage. Whether you want a managed, low-code interface or a fully custom SDK setup, begin here:

Managed Setup: Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform API Setup — The central control panel for all Google Cloud agent configurations.
The Low-Code Path: Agent Builder Guide — Best for rapid development using playbooks, managed grounding, and out-of-the-box data stores.
Developer SDK: Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform SDK for Python — The client library required for writing custom agent logic, tool calls, and API integrations.
Agent Starter Pack: Agent Engine Getting Started — Initialize your first custom agent backend.
